  r1,"mixed-raw-log-can-be-parsed-by-scanning-json-objects",一个混合日志文件（包含 stdout 文本、warnings、以及结构化日志 JSON）,"`scalim-cli` 逐行扫描并仅解析 JSON object",结构化日志记录 MUST 可被稳定提取（不依赖 `k=v` 或正则猜测）
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"every-jsonl-record-has-stable-base-fields",structured logging 已启用,任意 `scalim.*` logger 产生一条日志记录,输出 JSON object MUST 至少包含 `timestamp/level/logger/message`（或 compact profile 的对应缩写）
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"cli-can-normalize-compact-keys-to-full-keys",输入日志为 compact profile（使用缩写 key）,"`scalim-cli log ...` 解析并标准化 key",解析结果 MUST 可映射到全称 key 的统一内部模型（例如 `run_id` 而非 `rid`）
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
