  r5,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r5,"context-is-injected-without-passing-extra-fields-to-logger-c",runtime 在执行边界设置了当前 run/workflow/demand 上下文,任意 subsystem（例如 `performance`）输出一条结构化记录,该记录 MUST 自动携带可 join 的 `run_id/workflow_node_id/demand` 等上下文（当这些字段可获取时）
  r6,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r6,"structured-logging-can-be-enabled-via-env-and-via-explicit-a",用户通过环境变量启用 structured logging,运行一次 demand/workflow 执行,`scalim.*` 的输出 MUST 为 JSONL
  r7,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r7,"legacy-kv-console-report-lines-are-not-emitted-when-jsonl-is",structured logging 已启用,pipeline 运行并触发 performance/relations 的 report 输出,"输出 MUST 只包含 JSONL records（single-write）"
  r8,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r8,"cli-can-format-and-summarize-structured-logs-from-a-mixed-fi",输入为一份混合日志文件（JSONL records + 非 JSON 行）,"用户运行 `scalim-cli log fmt <file>` 与 `scalim-cli log summarize <file> --budget-chars=<n>`","CLI MUST 忽略非 JSON 行并输出 human-friendly 格式"